[36m(TaskRunner pid=333004)[0m For the polynomial \(x^2 + tx + r\) with root 5, we use Vieta's formulas:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=333004)[0m - The sum of the roots: \(5 + u = -t\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=333004)[0m - The product of the roots: \(5 \cdot u = r\)
